{
  "info": {
    "name": "Core8 - Detalle de Oferente (Microservicio REST)",
    "description": "Pruebas del microservicio Core8.\n\nHU Core8: a partir de la identificacion de un oferente, retorna todo su detalle (datos personales, ubicacion, correos, telefonos, preparacion academica, experiencia laboral, curriculums y postulaciones).\n\nComo usar:\n1. Arranca SRV_Core8_DetalleOferente. Queda en http://localhost:5208.\n2. El servicio no requiere autenticacion.\n3. 101230456 existe; 000000000 no existe (404).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5208",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Detalle de oferente (101230456) - 200",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/detalle-oferente/101230456",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "detalle-oferente",
            "101230456"
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "var body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Trae datos del oferente', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('identificacion');",
              "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('nombreCompleto');",
              "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('correos');",
              "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('postulaciones');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Oferente inexistente (000000000) - 404",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/detalle-oferente/000000000",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "detalle-oferente",
            "000000000"
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 404', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(404); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
